{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9798986c59134a598ff73d2bacbb1c473ac4748dea49434eeba85751f7fb9e54", "ja": "（今日は外回りの仕事があるため、\n早朝に出社して、雑務を片づけることにした）", "zh": "（因为今天有要跑外勤的工作，\n便决定提早上班，先把杂事处理好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f969d0d256655cc932dbe8c72096b28a11a1d311a02d9d75196f295b619c185c", "ja": "（正直眠いけど、みんなの方が大変なんだ。\n早起きごときで弱音を吐いてる場合……、ん？）", "zh": "（老实说很困，但大家比我更辛苦，\n不该为了早起这种小事而叫苦……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1002_se", "source_sha256": "632766b1963bbd5d65cd118f29217ec32140023fcf0802dafb4fd7ef14cacead", "ja": "パタパタパタ……", "zh": "啪哒啪哒啪哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "33d868004d1ece59ded5dd7582701d6615edecef83f3f01c06f048b72d7bfbf6", "ja": "（今、足音が聞こえたような……。\nレッスンルームの方か？）", "zh": "（刚刚好像听到了脚步声……\n是从练习室传来的吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0d010f3ecb415ca04148c19b9d012c1945c4cf8a72f074cae1e1e781e75ed01c", "ja": "おーい、誰か居るのか？", "zh": "喂──有人在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "9480b131c8c41514fd35488b540c4efede6160b0170ed8ceba14f358d06c02f4", "ja": "えっと、ここでターンして……あっ！\n{$P$}さん、おはようございます！", "zh": "唔，这里要转身……啊！\n{$P$}先生，早安！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7ab9996cfa54413dc61b6167dde7d7b29be972b879ae72db022778ef284280fb", "ja": "星梨花？　どうしたんだ、こんな早朝に……。", "zh": "星梨花？怎么了？这么早……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "53c4f0d04fa6d269b4e5a9378ea1b620018b5acabb713539ae259d7783331595", "ja": "はい、自主レッスンです！　夜遅くがダメでも、\n朝早くなら明るいし、大丈夫かと思って……。", "zh": "是的，我在自主练习！\n想说早上练习的话天是亮着的，应该没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "aee6ca460afed59aba533c439d5419ee2a8c080d13c95794d2ce594f28ccccd1", "ja": "それでわたし、パパにお願いしたんです。\n最初は反対されましたけど、許してもらえました！", "zh": "然后我就去拜托爸爸了，\n虽然一开始爸爸还是反对，但后来同意了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8ecc029b79c175645b679fcaf4e54f85ee65df646a35bcfd16f45bcb9dedf5f1", "ja": "そうか……自分でちゃんと、相談できたんだな。\nえらいぞ、星梨花！", "zh": "这样啊……你可以自己好好和爸爸商量了呢。\n你很了不起喔，星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "d338c029dd7067b6122510f59e1b9db038eca2b0df5a53a483bb005f8430ec4b", "ja": "えへへ……♪　{$P$}さん、\nこういうの、朝練っていうんですよね？", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪{$P$}先生，\n这就叫做晨练吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "a28e482f740501e2bcaa7d36457fe34534286ead88054dd9228b8f4d493568c4", "ja": "わたし、部活動ってしたことなかったから、\nなんだか楽しいです！", "zh": "我从来没有参加过社团活动，\n总觉得好有趣喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d808a5b0b8da3e8e54c056760f5c76cda661137a725beb95db4f06075a0f54b1", "ja": "はは、楽しく練習できてるならいいんだけど。\nでも、くれぐれも無理しないようにな？", "zh": "哈哈，你可以开心地练习就好了，\n但千万不要勉强自己喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "4f1f01c838c687618df3f336cdb7f31325f806fbc1ffb0eae7142f225d93de4c", "ja": "おはようございまーすっ！　……あれ？\n星梨花ちゃんと、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "早安──！\n……咦？是小星梨花和{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f0e5d80230f74b5574001893da4783a9b25bf14ca1b1abe79c97d7c37a6bfe66", "ja": "麗花、それに茜まで。\nこんな早くに、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "丽花，连茜都来了，\n怎么会这么早来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d5ea8f99d1a5d3c6b1f971ed6ebf926ee321fd0c89713f9ca490caa68c30a4f", "ja": "それはこっちのセリフだよ！　なんでこんな時間に、\n{$P$}ちゃんと星梨花ちゃんが？", "zh": "那是小茜要说的话！为什么这种时间\n小{$P$}和星梨花会出现在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "8aa49a1f91386deba9d82a33ee0ba1391cf0b42203bac31ad474e3ade19692d8", "ja": "茜さん、麗花さん、おはようございます！\nわたし、今日から朝練を始めることにしたんです。", "zh": "茜姊姊、丽花姊姊，早安！\n我决定从今天开始晨练了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "cf44cc175f6e23aa2a3b1579f1706186aaad0aa7d807767a4b8ad32c0bdda73e", "ja": "そうなの？　星梨花ちゃん、えらいね♪\n実は私と茜ちゃんも、秘密の特訓にきたんだ♪", "zh": "是吗？小星梨花真了不起呢♪\n其实我和小茜也是来做秘密特训的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9fb960a52ad2e77783feb640127621f62d1dc592ea8d2ec44f6b9b555b95bf71", "ja": "秘密の特訓……？\nちょっと待て茜、何を企んでいるんだ？", "zh": "秘密特训……？\n茜，等一下，你在打什么主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "d6c318222f3f58f75ea7c46d2a6e3511c147c61bcc620628747db7af598b5c39", "ja": "なんで茜ちゃんピンポイントなのさ！？\nまぁ、間違ってないけど……。", "zh": "为什么要针对小茜啦！？\n虽然是没错啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1021_023aka", "source_sha256": "4b51aa710643fe8b27bd83983a7f3f7daf3845af6cd29e587dc4fbcc7fd6fc1f", "ja": "実は茜ちゃんと麗花ちゃんで、\nお笑いコンビを結成しようと思ってね！", "zh": "其实小茜和小丽花\n决定要组成搞笑双人组！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1022_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8740b4d0c5c913e51ea70acfc9a20d54d610ac5a186238b151adcf17e932ca6", "ja": "えっ？　お、お笑いコンビ……ですか？", "zh": "咦？搞、搞笑双人组……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "7fd0fb52a7033b02cf9d46a31a973982b4ee23fd63b472bcf3325df6f66b9036", "ja": "そうなの♪　クレシェンドブルーの結成祝いが\nまだだったねって、茜ちゃんと話してて……。", "zh": "没错♪我和小茜说到还没庆祝过\n「Crescendo Blue」成军……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "6b41f5404798484f1cad0cab6737b8af2414683befdc3316a81d92db02e32d26", "ja": "ライブの前に、みんなで親睦会を開くことにしたのだ！\n我ながら、ナイスなアイディアだよね～。", "zh": "我们决定在演唱会前开个亲睦派对！\n小茜这个主意不错吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "2767b95d755daad5f8626c8124fdf67a8de4c32d887caf6a5822d5c4f39efa05", "ja": "親睦会か……。\n確かに、それもありかもしれないな。", "zh": "亲睦派对啊……\n这听起来的确可行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1026_048rei", "source_sha256": "755eb93126cae9a205365e347c1df6d5d977298997e481435fdcc1880718ce65", "ja": "せっかくの親睦会だし、何かしなくちゃっと思って♪\n私達の出し物は、お笑いコンビにしたんです！", "zh": "难得的亲睦派对，想说一定得做点什么♪\n所以我们就决定要表演搞笑双人组了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "05748622da6d22ac997e3ebecfc1008a9124ccaf32bb02124e0f1f5ce3380882", "ja": "そうか。出し物から決めるのか……。", "zh": "这样啊，从表演节目开始决定啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "4be496d9341d8655c9a3bd8a396a5f71b9e28b5c2827dbfe75b5f0c0cf95f922", "ja": "そして今日が初のネタ合わせ！　そのためだけに、\n茜ちゃん超早起きしたよ……エラくない？", "zh": "然后今天是我们第一次一起排练！就为了这个，\n小茜今天超早起的……很了不起吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "4ca8e86f182fb045eeac81cb365341f6094e1ffa7b31798e602746fc7fe8a045", "ja": "でも茜ちゃん。せっかく星梨花ちゃんが朝練してる\nなら、私達も混ぜてもらったほうが良くないかな？", "zh": "但是小茜，难得小星梨花在晨练，\n我们是不是也加入一起练比较好啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "8224e6faf5ce8bf9c09b57b4c7f10dea969588c1a62e07faacd7bcb4fd414592", "ja": "う～ん……まあネタ合わせしなくても、茜ちゃん達\nなら、聞く人の腹筋を断裂させるくらい楽勝だね！", "zh": "唔……就算不排练，只要是小茜我们，\n应该能轻轻松松让观众笑破肚皮吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "66711cb0de76ad3a9865644622fe11bb07f6cc1471f2b7e2dfc9365286e9f17c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}ちゃん！　お笑いコンビの\nことは、モガミンとしほりんにはまだ秘密だからね！", "zh": "啊，小{$P$}！搞笑双人组的事\n先别告诉静香香和志保保喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "02672169235a4da46bc61b2bd811d994c4fb4ff9be52ce2e205f1699ea632b90", "ja": "ナイショにして、ビックリさせたいんです。\nふふっ♪", "zh": "我们打算先保密，然后吓她们一跳。\n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1033_p", "source_sha256": "73014f96c2a18fd0025c31779961afd8aa6e1124541441891248cabaf2f8642f", "ja": "わかった。言わないでおくよ。", "zh": "明白了，我不会说的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "a3d86850dae9a6ad1dc14679069282a86d7c0fade753b00b62b28d17d0580b08", "ja": "それじゃ、星梨花ちゃん、茜ちゃん。\n今日のところは、練習頑張ろうね！", "zh": "那么，小星梨花、小茜，\n今天就先一起努力练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1035_023aka", "source_sha256": "376b71ced9d5906d92396ab769c9d9a767da3e04b06d9a7b6eb63b84914360fb", "ja": "おーっ♪", "zh": "好──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1036_022ser", "source_sha256": "3c7771bc57074c3a61742bdfb72200adf6b15630b27ee44f3cad5abc3286e864", "ja": "お、おーっ！", "zh": "好、好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "39ae1510572a5735d37bb7358f3b288febdb5656e3b75d842ed502ec830bc83e", "ja": "（みんながそれぞれ、自分達なりに、このユニットが\n上手くいくようにと工夫をこらしている……）", "zh": "（大家都在用自己的方法，努力让这个团体\n能更顺利合作……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "6b389cac769dbd4aa5eb1ba8e5f0b37cc3a294eea9b655baa67ac318c7634173", "ja": "（クレシェンドブルー、なんだかんだ言って、\nいいユニットになりそうじゃないか）", "zh": "（总觉得，「Crescendo Blue」\n将会成为很不错的团体呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "52b0b980bde44df42285d3ed41f778516be97bb03a387398bd6fa13eb03a07f2", "ja": "（やれやれ、外回りですっかり遅くなってしまった。\nみんなは、もう帰った頃かな……）", "zh": "（真是的，外勤工作做到这么晚，\n大家应该都差不多要回去了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "171e4354b9e2eca6021e060d6829d31892e33175d682303481951d3ece137142", "ja": "…………っ！？\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "…………！？\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "152b8786567bdc174ea2063dae8888422afd68186de9000ed2bad4c0c145e90a", "ja": "志保？　どうしたんだ、そんなに急いで。\nレッスンはもう、終わったのか？", "zh": "志保？这么急急忙忙的是怎么了？\n训练课程已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1042_033sih", "source_sha256": "5d691ddfb908479cb72b7de2cf579bd6710b53ab5078c23b1ffee38eaa182536", "ja": "っ……すみません。私、もう無理です。\nユニット、抜けさせてください。", "zh": "……对不起，我已经受不了了，\n请让我退出这个团体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "96864543afd45105fc11a305743671ebcafff64a00a1a57936bb3e0ad372eab4", "ja": "え！？　抜けるって志保、一体何が……。", "zh": "咦！？你要退出？志保，到底发生了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1044_033sih", "source_sha256": "ee7ae12a5e67326431839ac7d40be348105d85802089039bbfaa3cb026a43ff7", "ja": "失礼します！", "zh": "我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "f48e3652c5dcd05185f98c6c9529488e91023cb45919cc7d500989fcc1947ad4", "ja": "あっ、志保！？\n行ってしまった……何があったんだ？", "zh": "啊，志保！？\n走掉了……到底是发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "c7d3251a091c65c8949b6274777faf1a9fea88d8a5270f17480af9b29997b99c", "ja": "待って、志保……！\nあっ、{$P$}？", "zh": "等一下，志保……！\n啊，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1047_022ser", "source_sha256": "1e4a302b803a4425925ccb10510878bcfd84bdbc946f28ae298ad6ff0614d9d9", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nあの、こちらに志保さんが来ませんでしたか！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n那个，志保姊姊有经过这里吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1048_p", "source_sha256": "d8c588fefa3333f91ca26621f6e154ae7f826b361898b23dc8129f889ce3b874", "ja": "ああ、今すれ違ったけど……どうしたんだ？\nユニットを抜けるとか何とか言ってたけど……。", "zh": "有，刚刚擦身而过……发生什么事了？\n她说要退出团体之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1049_023aka", "source_sha256": "fa356d2a983c77ace129e02dbf3f89c868fe6ee50d8b9bb5be75ed0d2d3066ee", "ja": "そうだよ、大変だよ{$P$}ちゃん！\n茜ちゃんたちが漫才の練習をしてたら……。", "zh": "对呀，大事不好了，小{$P$}！\n小茜我们刚刚一练习相声……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1050_048rei", "source_sha256": "0440a20949752decab3566c1eb03a7772a0045e51716153f7a10aab91747b219", "ja": "志保ちゃん、怒って出て行っちゃいました……。\n自分はもう抜けるから、4人で頑張って、って。", "zh": "小志保就气得跑掉了……\n她说自己要退出，叫我们四个人自己加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1051_023aka", "source_sha256": "382d7bbfe7809a462c97266f3d48953969bce91a2d322b913a4f075f4ff63402", "ja": "茜ちゃん、しほりんを笑わせようと思ったんだよ～。\n絶対爆笑だと思ったのに……。", "zh": "小茜本来想逗志保保笑的呀～\n还以为她一定会大爆笑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1052_022ser", "source_sha256": "1ec63e354f0aad1a4f7a54451d46ff649306701a56b08a615d15290712c6be9d", "ja": "い、いえ……やっぱり、わたしのせいで……\nレッスンが遅れてるから……。", "zh": "不、不是……应该是我的错……\n因为我在课程时慢了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1053_015siz", "source_sha256": "df296238b5c062bcfd35f31d9a2a6d78f4bf2ca1be1c0e7edba2d850a3a4c5ef", "ja": "違うわ、みんなは悪くない。全部私の責任なの。\nリーダーの私が、もっとちゃんとしていれば……。", "zh": "不是的，大家没有错，这全都是我的责任。\n要是我这个队长再当得好一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_1054", "source_sha256": "031c443c5da87b9dd2e0a4f7be97b4b0e6680c3a6028a1f43fea57f128b37d80", "ja": "いいや", "zh": "不", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "11bb460d68b14018bef15ba4ebcaceb8ad56b5f0c74889fdce97d9888ec84bf9", "ja": "いいや、違うな……。昨日、志保と話すって言ったのに\n話せてなかった、俺のせいだ。", "zh": "不，不对……昨天我明明说要去和志保谈谈，\n最后却没去，是我的错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_2001_022ser", "source_sha256": "abbc3b4ac655978c66f7ef95bbd2e97da1fddb63902bada21fb4a3312e8e57f5", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんはお仕事で……。", "zh": "但{$P$}先生是因为工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_2002_p", "source_sha256": "286e0c0aaa660a09a5409bd4ec9f66d8a4f2718d888c724778213deadfac1bb8", "ja": "志保と話すのも、何より大事な仕事だよ。", "zh": "和志保谈话是比其他事都更重要的工作喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_2003_p", "source_sha256": "0ea02913d82d8d7cadd9f2ccd35efdb73a5fd802bad9c92e2eeb838778128cca", "ja": "だから、みんなは気にしなくていい。\n後のことは、いったん俺に任せてくれないか？", "zh": "所以大家不用介意，\n接下来的事可以先交给我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_2004_p", "source_sha256": "e1206ba171e30af44ca2bc328a616e8a116ede39238d148e61fc1264bc5e499f", "ja": "……大丈夫だよ。\n志保は、必ず戻ってくるから。", "zh": "……没问题的，\n志保一定会回来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_2005_015siz", "source_sha256": "ebd08c593605df4f2805bfb5d462769a3c676f7aa3ab44bc428b5b048bfbb487", "ja": "{$P$}……わかりました。\nよろしくお願いします……。", "zh": "{$P$}……我知道了，\n就拜托你了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_2006_p", "source_sha256": "52aa287b54f1164e0bf785ab9363d5aa8faa5210fee371711d7d7e2609781433", "ja": "（誰が欠けても、クレシェンドブルーは完成しない。\n目指している景色はきっと、5人とも同じなんだ）", "zh": "（只要缺了一个人，「Crescendo Blue」就无法完成，\n五个人的目标一定都是相同的景色。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "a6fea55f33ffdf5ca623f86ac9e3bea327c19e6533ee4c8a6a148250fe5dc820", "ja": "散らばった欠片", "zh": "四散的碎片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0004_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0004_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "42fe90459c73575d2eca20a941fb1fdac91396dcca9e9aa8146561ba6ffa2146", "ja": "夜までレッスンができないため、早朝に自主\nレッスンを始めた星梨花。茜と麗花も合流し\n事態は丸く収まったように見えたが…\nプロデューサーは、ユニットを抜けるといい\n立ち去る志保に出会い、追いかけることに。", "zh": "因无法在晚上练习，星梨花便开始在早上进行\n自主练习，且茜和丽花也一起加入。\n眼看事情就要顺利解决……志保却说\n要退出团体并离开现场，制作人因此追了上去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
